return {h=12,w=360,cr=190,hc=20,bh=70,gr="medium",eg={"monster","water1"},st={90,65,65,40,40,15},ab={{12,0},{20,0},{144,1}},genus={en="Dopey Pokémon",es="Pokémon Atontado",pt="Pokémon Lerdo"},flavor={en={[1]="Incredibly slow and dopey. It takes 5 seconds for it to feel pain when under attack.",[2]="Incredibly slow and dopey. It takes 5 seconds for it to feel pain when under attack.",[3]="Incredibly slow and sluggish. It is quite content to loll about without worrying about the time.",[4]="It lazes vacantly near water. If something bites its tail, it won't even notice for a whole day.",[5]="A sweet sap leaks from its tail's tip. Although not nutritious, the tail is pleasant to chew on.",[6]="It is always so absent-minded that it won't react, even if its flavorful tail is bitten.",[7]="SLOWPOKE uses its tail to catch prey by dipping it in water at the side of a river. However, this Pokémon often forgets what it’s doing and often spends entire days just loafing at water’s edge.",[8]="SLOWPOKE uses its tail to catch prey by dipping it in water at the side of a river. However, this Pokémon often forgets what it’s doing and often spends entire days just loafing at water’s edge.",[9]="It catches prey by dipping its tail in water at the side of a river. But it often forgets what it is doing and spends entire days just loafing at water’s edge.",[10]="It is always vacantly lost in thought, but no one knows what it is thinking about. It is good at fishing with its tail.",[11]="Incredibly slow and dopey. It takes five seconds for it to feel pain when under attack.",[12]="Although slow, it is skilled at fishing with its tail. It does not feel pain if its tail is bitten.",[13]="Although slow, it is skilled at fishing with its tail. It does not feel pain if its tail is bitten.",[14]="Although slow, it is skilled at fishing with its tail. It does not feel pain if its tail is bitten.",[15]="It lazes vacantly near water. If something bites its tail, it won’t even notice for a whole day.",[16]="A sweet sap leaks from its tail’s tip. Although not nutritious, the tail is pleasant to chew on.",[17]="Although slow, it is skilled at fishing with its tail. It does not feel pain if its tail is bitten.",[18]="Although slow, it is skilled at fishing with its tail. It does not feel pain if its tail is bitten.",[21]="Although slow, it is skilled at fishing with its tail. It does not feel pain if its tail is bitten.",[22]="Although slow, it is skilled at fishing with its tail. It does not feel pain if its tail is bitten.",[23]="It is always vacantly lost in thought, but no one knows what it is thinking about. It is good at fishing with its tail.",[24]="It lazes vacantly near water. If something bites its tail, it won’t even notice for a whole day.",[25]="Slowpoke uses its tail to catch prey by dipping it in water at the side of a river. However, this Pokémon often forgets what it’s doing and often spends entire days just loafing at water’s edge.",[26]="Slowpoke uses its tail to catch prey by dipping it in water at the side of a river. However, this Pokémon often forgets what it’s doing and often spends entire days just loafing at water’s edge.",[27]="Its long tail often breaks off. It doesn’t really feel any pain, though, and the tail grows back, so Slowpoke isn’t particularly bothered.",[28]="Alolan home cooking involves drying Slowpoke tails and then simmering them into a salty stew.",[29]="There are some places where Slowpoke is worshiped because of a long-standing belief that whenever Slowpoke yawns, it rains.",[30]="Although their tails, which fall off naturally, can easily be found lying around, they’re a precious ingredient for cooking.",[31]="Incredibly slow and sluggish. It is quite content to loll about without worrying about the time.",[32]="Incredibly slow and sluggish. It is quite content to loll about without worrying about the time.",[33]="Slow-witted and oblivious, this Pokémon won’t feel any pain if its tail gets eaten. It won’t notice when its tail grows back, either.",[34]="When this Pokémon’s tail is soaked in water, sweetness seeps from it. Slowpoke uses this trait to lure in and fish up other Pokémon."},es={[23]="Está siempre en su mundo, pero nadie sabe en qué piensa. Suele pescar con la cola.",[24]="Descansa ocioso junto al agua. Si algo muerde su cola, no lo notará en todo el día.",[25]="Slowpoke usa la cola para atrapar a sus presas metiéndola bajo el agua en las riberas de los ríos. Con todo, es olvidadizo, se le puede pasar lo que estaba haciendo y quedarse días enteros holgazaneando en la orilla.",[26]="Slowpoke usa la cola para atrapar a sus presas metiéndola bajo el agua en las riberas de los ríos. Con todo, es olvidadizo, se le puede pasar lo que estaba haciendo y quedarse días enteros holgazaneando en la orilla.",[27]="Pierde la cola con frecuencia, pero, como no le duele y le crece de nuevo rápidamente, no le da ninguna importancia.",[28]="Un plato típico de la cocina de Alola son las colas de Slowpoke desecadas y cocinadas en agua salada.",[29]="La leyenda afirma que su bostezo atrae las lluvias, por lo que en ciertas regiones lo consideran prácticamente una deidad.",[30]="Su cola se desprende con facilidad de forma natural y es un ingrediente muy valorado en la elaboración de platos de alta cocina.",[31]="Es increíblemente lento y perezoso. Se toma las cosas con calma, sin preocuparse por el paso del tiempo.",[32]="Es increíblemente lento y perezoso. Se toma las cosas con calma, sin preocuparse por el paso del tiempo.",[33]="Es lento y abstraído. Aunque le devoren la cola, ni siquiera se percata, ya que no siente ningún dolor. Tampoco nota cuando le vuelve a crecer.",[34]="Hunde la cola en el agua y la usa cual caña de pescar. La sustancia dulce que secreta le sirve de cebo para atraer a sus presas."},pt="Quando a cauda deste Pokémon fica de molho na água, solta um sabor doce. Slowpoke usa essa característica para atrair e pescar outros Pokémon."},evo={{s=79},{s=80,from=79,c={{t="le